end":{"line":9,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"A charmed entity is drained of an amount of vitality over time. At the start of their turn, they automatically take 1 die of psychic damage and loose 2 stamina. Additionally, charmed creatures cannot attack or harm the creature that charmed it, and treats this creature as an ally. At the end of a charmed creatures’ turn, it makes a Psychic Fortitude test to break the charm.\\","position":{"start":{"line":9,"column":1},"end":{"line":9,"column":1}},"key":"QaDq14hQNe"}],"key":"JKqc7fGAcs"}],"key":"DCgk6W5CrM"},{"type":"tableRow","position":{"start":{"line":10,"column":1},"end":{"line":10,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"tableCell","position":{"start":{"line":10,"column":1},"end":{"line":10,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Dying","position":{"start":{"line":10,"column":1},"end":{"line":10,"column":1}},"key":"KcXHfdAmzS"}],"key":"bpHVVU7UUs"},{"type":"tableCell","position":{"start":{"line":10,"column":1},"end":{"line":10,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Unconscious and making risk/death rolls during the environmental turn.","position":{"start":{"line":10,"column":1},"end":{"line":10,"column":1}},"key":"KrZwJBzNEd"}],"key":"L60tIzNA8J"}],"key":"d1kCp7Qt7f"},{"type":"tableRow","position":{"start":{"line":11,"column":1},"end":{"line":11,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"tableCell","position":{"start":{"line":11,"column":1},"end":{"line":11,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Freezing","position":{"start":{"line":11,"column":1},"end":{"line":11,"column":1}},"key":"ZFnfSCrv6d"}],"key":"Lvhz5V9nXm"},{"type":"tableCell","position":{"start":{"line":11,"column":1},"end":{"line":11,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"A freezing entity takes the relevant die of cold damage at the start of their turn and looses 2 stamina. The freezing condition can be broken via potions, any healing magic, and certain spells, or by leaving the region causing the active condition.","position":{"start":{"line":11,"column":1},"end":{"line":11,"column":1}},"key":"OBytcmV8i8"}],"key":"Einpbhs4t5"}],"key":"ezozMe7sd1"},{"type":"tableRow","position":{"start":{"line":12,"column":1},"end":{"line":12,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"tableCell","position":{"start":{"line":12,"column":1},"end":{"line":12,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Incapacitated","position":{"start":{"line":12,"column":1},"end":{"line":12,"column":1}},"key":"NkgVB7fH1q"}],"key":"Ni7e1wxu0J"},{"type":"tableCell","position":{"start":{"line":12,"column":1},"end":{"line":12,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"You cannot move, interact, make attack actions, or channel spells in combat, unless a grit is used to facilitate the first two. You have 0 HP and have no stamina, but can make simple perception, personality, or reasoning checks. Out of combat, you can move with some assistance. Achieving a rest while incapacitated changes your condition to diminished.","position":{"start":{"line":12,"column":1},"end":{"line":12,"column":1}},"key":"wDrIifZq0Y"}],"key":"ZYKhWK692V"}],"key":"GRh8EVJOha"},{"type":"tableRow","position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":1},"end":{"line":13,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"tableCell","position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":1},"end":{"line":13,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Diminished","position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":1},"end":{"line":13,"column":1}},"key":"ZjhMQY7E24"}],"key":"KuvLgxLirN"},{"type":"tableCell","position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":1},"end":{"line":13,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"You have a max HP of 20 and 3 stamina/round. All attacks are made with -5 penalty, and your toxicity is at minimum half its TV, and your maximum movement is halved. Resting while diminished changes your condition to exhausted, and healing spells cannot heal you for more than those 20 HP.\\","position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":1},"end":{"line":13,"column":1}},"key":"FhJA9SZrvd"}],"key":"